# ================= CORE CALORIE ADVISOR — git exclusions =================
# Created by §0.4 PRE-FLIGHT before `git init`, so that no secret ever
# enters git history. Do not reorder: .env MUST stay listed.

# Secrets — .env holds 20 live keys (Anthropic, Stripe, Google/Facebook/Instagram OAuth, DB)
.env

# Runtime / user data — not product source
logs/
uploads/

# Developer audit workspace (57 MB). Evidence PNGs stay on disk, just untracked.
_audit/

# Archives & backups
*.zip
*.bak
*.old
